<title>UK: Argentina sets $750 million 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Argentina sets $750 million 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following global bond was announced by joint lead managers Goldman Sachs and Salomon Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ARGENTINA</p>
<p> AMT	  $750 MLN  COUPON     **	  MATURITY    09.OCT.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    09.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.875     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD    +445-450 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED BY WEDNESDAY</p>
<p> MOODY	B1	  LISTING    LUX/B.A.  PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BB-	 DENOMS (K) 1	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  ARGENTINA TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.00 PCT U.S. TREASURY NOTE DUE 15.JUL.06</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
